      title: '2.0 Concurrency 101: Your First Goroutine, Buffered Channels & sync.WaitGroup',
      summary: 'Bridges Level 1 sequential Go into Level 2 concurrency: how to launch background work safely, wait for completion with sync.WaitGroup, and collect results without data races.',
      diagram: '[main goroutine] --(wg.Add(1) + go worker())--> [Worker Goroutines] --(ch <- n*n)--> [Buffered Channel] --> [wg.Wait() + Sum]',
