      moduleTitle: 'Stage H — Architecture 101: Handler, Service & Repository Separation',
      title: '8.0 Architecture 101: Separating Handler, Service & Repository Without Boilerplate',
      summary: 'Answers the #1 architecture question for Go learners: how to separate HTTP transport, domain business rules, and SQL queries cleanly before exploring Hexagonal/DDD in Lesson 8.1.',
